Subject: Use native allocation size signatures in original class allocators
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Use std::size_t in native class operator-new declarations and their matching
out-of-line definitions, including LLP64 hosts. Retain the original allocation
bodies, pools, class fields and console declarations. Existing size-bearing
nlMalloc remains unchanged; measured selected class requests fit its u32 size.

